  "description": "YITAMOTOR 42\" Skid Steer Pallet forks Blades. This skid steer pallet forks blade has 2500 lbs Bearing Capacity, Can easily and quickly haul lumber, and firewood, move fence posts, hay bales, etc.\nFitment\nThe frontier pallet fork fits a slotted skid steer pallet fork frame for use with Kubota, John Deere, Bobcat skid steers loaders tractors.\nFeatures\n2500 LBS Load Capacity\nYITAMOTOR skid steer pallet fork blades can easily carry heavy loads, empowering you to tackle the toughest jobs.\nWide Range of Uses\nThe pallet fork blades can be used to lift and move construction materials, debris, and broken fences, or alternatively used to move and transport logs, lumber, timber, and firewood; You can even use it to haul away debris, logs, steel beams, and more.\nEasy to Install\nThe forklift blades can b.ily be mounted to the skid steer pallet fork frame without much effort, allowing you to work efficiently on the farm, warehouse, and construction site.\nCompatibility\nThe frontier pallet fork fits a slotted skid steer pallet fork frame for use with Kubota, John Deere, Bobcat skid steers loaders tractors.\nProduct Dimensions\nThe pallet fork's total weight: 74.96 lbs, overall length: 42 inches, overall width: 4 inches, overall height: 22 inches, and thickness: 6mm; Package includes: a pair of pallet fork blades.",
